  "summary_text": "Thread Based Decision Support System for Online Examination. This project presents the design and implementation of a decision support system that applies thread and file system to automate routine tasks. The system was developed using Java and MySQL and tested on data collected from user surveys. The existing system relies on manual effort and does not use thread. Earlier work proposed a method based on file system which improved results on benchmark data. Finally file system is used to produce the output which is displayed to the user. Integration of file system may further improve accuracy. The system demonstrates that thread can be applied effectively to this problem.",
